iversified instruments, including INR285 crores of subordinated debt","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Shareholders approved a promoter infusion of INR100 crores.","quote":"Shareholders have approved the promoter infusion of INR100 crores at approximately a 17% premium to the minimum issue price under SEBI regulation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Assam was severely impacted by floods affecting four districts, though the region has almost fully recovered.","quote":"Assam, where four districts were severely impacted by floods, has almost fully recovered with no discernible impact on our credit cost.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management flagged potential rural cash flow risks due to the monsoon outlook.","quote":"The revised monsoon outlook warrants caution on rural cash flows over the next 2 to 3 months.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Assam operations were impacted by severe floods in three districts.","quote":"For instance, Assam, one of our key states, where portfolio exposure is currently experiencing severe floods, while 3 districts, Jorhat, Sivasagar, and Charaideo have been impacted.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Consolidated AUM is targeted to reach ₹32,000 Crores by FY-2030.","quote":"Consolidated AUM targe